    <mxCell id="legend_bg" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="35" y="730" width="1875" height="118" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend_title" value="Legend &amp; Invariants" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="49" y="736" width="1847" height="22" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend_text" value="1. Events: T1 sack_registered, T2 picked_up_at_farm, T3/T4 received_at_center, T5 bound_at_center, T6 departed_to_port, T7/T8 delivered_at_port.&lt;br/&gt;2. Receiver first: the party that now holds the sack records T3, T4, T7 or T8 even if the previous step is missing; the gap is flagged.&lt;br/&gt;3. A sack without a label gets a center reserve code at reception (T5).&lt;br/&gt;4. Solid = normal transition; dashed red = rejection; dashed blue = receiver-first skip; thick border = terminal." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="49" y="758" width="1847" height="86" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
